e richness of divine blessings; in Jerusalem, it comes from moist winds from the Mediterranean Sea. ",{"c":["Mount Hermon"],"sourceClass":"sn-excerpt","t":"span"},{"c":[","],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," which is capped with snow, is a place of abundant moisture. • A ",{"c":["blessing"],"sourceClass":"sn-excerpt","t":"span"}," is God’s life-giving power, a guarantee of his provision and protection (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.5.12","r":"Ps.5.12","rawR":"Ps.5.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.5.12","value":"Ps.5.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"5:12"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.41.2","r":"Ps.41.2","rawR":"Ps.41.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.41.2","value":"Ps.41.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"41:2"},"), secured by his presence (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.21.6","r":"Ps.21.6","rawR":"Ps.21.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.21.6","value":"Ps.21.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"21:6"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.67.1","r":"Ps.67.1","rawR":"Ps.67.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.67.1","value":"Ps.67.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"67:1"},"). Even the other nations will ultimately be blessed (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.67.1-7","r":"Ps.67.1-7","rawR":"Ps.67.1-7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.67.1-7","value":"Ps.67.1-7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Pss 67"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.72.17","r":"Ps.72.17","rawR":"Ps.72.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.72.17","value":"Ps.72.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"72:17"},"). Zion is the focal point of God’s blessing (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.134.3","r":"Ps.134.3","rawR":"Ps.134.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.134.3","value":"Ps.134.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"134:3"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.147.13","r":"Ps.147.13","rawR":"Ps.147.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.147.13","value":"Ps.147.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"147:13"},"). • God gives ",{"c":["life everlasting"],"sourceClass":"sn-excerpt","t":"span"}," to human beings."],"sourceClass":"sn-text","t":"p"}],"id":"StudyNote:Ps.133.3","refs":[{"book":"PSA","endChapter":133,"endVerse":3,"startChapter":133,"startVerse":3}],"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Ps.133.3","product":"TyndaleOpenStudyNotes","typename":"StudyNote"},"sourceBookAppCode":"PSA",